"HELP response: Flexible Timers sends account verification codes and\n      reminder SMS you schedule for yourself. Help:\n      https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html. Reply STOP to opt out." = "HELPAntwort:Flexible Timerssendet Kontoverifizierungs- und\n      Erinnerungs-CodesSMSSie können dies selbst planen. Hilfe:https://xintechllc.com/FlexibleTimers/support.html.AntwortenSTOPum die Abmeldung zu bestätigen.";
